      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      A 10-15 year climb is not a countdown. It is a series of specific, checkable transitions.
    </p>
    <p>
      Know which stage you are actually on, which lever is weakest right now, and build that one thing next — instead of assuming another year of tenure will do it for you.
    </p>
